zig-git: update to 0.18.0-dev.624+b7f2c6d8f

Development snapshot of Zig master, built against LLVM 23 from wip/llvm
(lang/zig 0.17.0 follows lang/llvm 22; Zig master requires LLVM 23.x).

Changes since zig-git-0.11.0:
* Track upstream on Codeberg; the GitHub repository is a stale mirror.
* Pin GIT_REVISION and pass -DZIG_VERSION, since the checkout has no tags.
* Follow lang/zig: devel/cmake/build.mk, ZIG_SHARED_LLVM, no RELRO/PIE,
  per-WRKDIR zig caches, skip stage3 at build time, langref.html into
  share/doc/zig. Patches and application.mk taken from lang/zig.
* Build zig2.c with -fno-tree-sra under GCC (GCC bug 119085): upstream
  applies it only up to GCC 14.3, but NetBSD's gcc 14.4.0 still
  miscompiles zig2, which then fails building compiler_rt.
* Drop obsolete patches (PIE toggle and NetBSD PT_LOAD fix are upstream),
  the debug option and buildlink3.mk.
* Remove do-test: `zig build` no longer takes --global-cache-dir, and
  test-behavior exceeds FFS per-directory subdirectory limits.
